UUID: e20a64bf-8173-3e16-a978-31ff7672e165
Heat delivered by the boiler not including losses and electricity demand for heat circulation in the house.
Location: Assumption for operation in Switzerland.
Technology: Average modulating, condensing boiler used in 2016.
Time period: Estimation for efficiency of boilers sold in 2016.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data published in technical data sheets. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e20a64bf-8173-3e16-a978-31ff7672e165.xml</text>
